            </note>
            <note corresp="#d123-f2" n="2" xml:id="d123-f2-content">
                <p>Regarding the Bermuda Conference, Dec. 4–8, see the editorial note, <ref
                        target="#pg1285">p. 1285</ref>.</p>
            </note>
